{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53791","headline":"题天柱峰 · 白居易","name":"题天柱峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太微星斗拱琼宫，圣祖琳宫镇九垓。\n天柱一峰擎日月，洞门千仞锁云雷。\n玉光白橘相争秀，金翠佳莲蕊鬬开。\n时访左慈高隐处，紫清仙鹤认巢来。\n（《天柱山志》）（按：《舆地纪胜》收三、四两句爲南唐李明作，详本书卷四十四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}